# Audit Skills (imported)

Purpose:
  Read-only audit workflows from khasky/awesome-agent-skills — design docs/ADRs
  and whole-project architecture audits with SHIP/FIX/BLOCK verdicts.

Owns: ./

Source: https://github.com/khasky/awesome-agent-skills
Origin: fetched from raw.githubusercontent.com (skills/{name}/SKILL.md)
Imported: 2026-09-06
Format: anthropic-skill (SKILL.md docs-only, adapted via INDEX.sdd wrapper)
License: MIT (verified in SKILL.md frontmatter + repo)
Runtime: none (docs-only workflows)

Skills:
  awesome-design-doc:
    one_line: Requirements-first design doc/ADR — real alternatives, non-goals, migration path
    use: SDDRA phase specs and DEC records
  awesome-architecture-audit:
    one_line: Read-only whole-project architecture audit with SHIP/FIX/BLOCK verdict
    use: SDDRA verification (VR) stage and drift detection

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @awesome-design-doc.md
   3  @awesome-architecture-audit.md

Modes:
  APPLY    — produce a design doc / run an audit
  AUDIT    — audit-only pass

Rules:
  [AU1] SHIP/FIX/BLOCK verdicts map to SDDRA PASS/WARN/BLOCK semantics.
  [AU2] awesome-design-doc output feeds decisions/ (DEC records) and phases/ specs.
  [AU3] External origin — apply import rules from CLAUDE.md.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd

Navigation:
  Audit: @INDEX.sdd
  DesignDoc: @awesome-design-doc.md
  ArchitectureAudit: @awesome-architecture-audit.md
  ImportedRegistry: @../INDEX.sdd

State: +
